rollout_summaries / notes; restrained & passive write discipline; idempotent
integration fingerprint+watermark) and its LLM extraction prompt are **inspired
by, and adapted from, the memory system of [openai/codex](https://github.com/openai/codex)**,
which is licensed under the **Apache License, Version 2.0**.

This plugin is an independent re-implementation for DeepSeek Harness; it borrows
the design ideas and a distilled prompt approach, but does not redistribute
openai/codex source code verbatim. Attribution and license of the originating
project is preserved as required by Apache 2.0.

Related / derived-from sources:
- openai/codex (Apache License 2.0) — memory model + extraction prompt design
- flymysql/dsh-memory (MIT) — the original npm package this plugin was adapted
